{"availability":"available","full":"korjavin/german-conjuctions-trainer","name":"german-conjuctions-trainer","description":"Self-hosted German grammar trainer: AI-generated sentence-building exercises, spaced repetition and podcast mode. Bring your own LLM (Claude, OpenAI).","category":"Education","language":"Go","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2025-08-16T20:03:40Z","updated":"2026-10-13T16:13:12Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://srs.wandergeek.org/","topics":["ai","anthropic","claude","docker","elevenlabs","flashcards","german","german-language","golang","grammar","language-learning","learn-german","llm","openai","pwa","self-hosted","spaced-repetition","sqlite","srs","text-to-speech"],"demo":"https://srs.wandergeek.org/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:52.325Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:52.325Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T18:52:52.325Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.678Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T18:52:52.325Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Go"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Stop memorizing rules. Build German sentences until word order feels natural.","An open-source, self-hosted language trainer: an LLM writes fresh B1-level exercises for any grammar topic you describe, spaced repetition decides what you review, and podcast mode lets you keep drilling on a walk.","Try the live demo → · Run your own · What's new"],"features":["🧩 Build the sentence. See English, tap the German words in order (or press 1–9 / a–z, or answer by voice). Punctuation is placed for you.","🤖 Unlimited AI exercises. Describe a topic in plain words; the model writes varied sentences for it. Works with Claude, OpenAI or any OpenAI-compatible API, with automatic fallback when credits run out.","🧠 Spaced repetition. Log in with Google and the trainer schedules reviews and brings back what you got wrong.","💡 Explains your mistakes. Put a word in the wrong place and the AI tells you why — Time before Place, seit + Dativ — in plain English.","🎧 Podcast mode. Turn a topic into a Glossika-style MP3: listen, then recall. Private RSS feed for any podcast app."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/korjavin/german-conjuctions-trainer/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"79e6af68433f10145350056ed4ed7073325ab52aab98ebe23312a0ad2aa4430e","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.868Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.868Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Stop memorizing rules. Build German sentences until word order feels natural.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/korjavin/german-conjuctions-trainer/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Log in with Google and the trainer schedules reviews and brings back what you got wrong.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/korjavin/german-conjuctions-trainer/blob/master/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"For persistent storage, Claude, Google login, audio and podcasts see Running with Docker and Environment Variables.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/korjavin/german-conjuctions-trainer/blob/master/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"79e6af68433f10145350056ed4ed7073325ab52aab98ebe23312a0ad2aa4430e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/korjavin/german-conjuctions-trainer/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.869Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T13:06:15Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/korjavin/german-conjuctions-trainer/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.870Z","hash":"79e6af68433f10145350056ed4ed7073325ab52aab98ebe23312a0ad2aa4430e","originalBytes":24884,"storedBytes":24884,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T14:53:09.678Z","subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","Browser extensions & PWAs","Music & audio","Self-hosted apps"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Education","subje